# One line ending, decided here rather than by whichever machine touched a file
# last. Several source files had picked up mixed CRLF and LF endings, so editing
# one line rewrote the whole file in the diff and buried the real change in five
# hundred lines of nothing. Worse, two agents working the same file that way
# collide on every line instead of on the one either of them changed.
#
# LF in the repository, LF in the working tree. Windows editors handle it, and
# it matches what core.autocrlf was already storing.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so git never tries to translate anything inside them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
